AegisBank AI is a proof of concept written as the final project of the postgraduate course
"Seguridad y Gobernanza en Agentes de IA" (Facultad de Informática). It is shared for academic
evaluation and educational use only: you may read, run and study it locally.

THIS SOFTWARE IS DELIBERATELY VULNERABLE. It reproduces a security threat (Goal Hijacking /
Confused Deputy) on purpose and has no semantic defenses. Do not deploy it with real credentials,
real customer data or real funds. Any other use (including commercial use or redistribution)
requires the author's written permission.

The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
